"than expected, check the JPEG test and the diagnostics counters. A camera that "
"fails every few downloads will naturally produce fewer usable frames. GIF "
"frames are normalized to one size and resized so the final animation stays "
"under Maximum image size when possible. Existing oversized GIF files are "
"regenerated from cached frames when they are used and frames are available. "
"The GIF preview keeps the original aspect ratio, so it should not be distorted "
"by the browser."
